# Repo-root `.gitignore` rejects `*.key` to keep real DNSSEC / TLS /
# SSH keys out of version control. These BIND key files are the
# generated throwaway material for the wire-level smoke harness —
# they sign a private `example.test.` zone and are never trusted by
# any real validator. Whitelisting them by basename keeps the
# regeneration flow (`go run keygen.go example.test.`) friction-free
# while leaving the global rule strict for everything else.
!K*.key
!K*.private
